+The prototype's existing broader numeric scheduling is retained; this validator does not accept that separate B mechanism into the standalone HEAD patch. Invalid/unused-fallback and pending-provider rows remain relevant to A, while the retained em/px demand/completion rows exercise the prototype's existing capability. CSS-wide inheritance checks the returned value; the bridge does not expose INHERITS_RESET_STYLE. No broader effect observation or production pending activation is claimed.
